flowchart LR
  subgraph V[Portal User]
    A([Start]) --> B[Open tender detail]
    B --> C[Click Next]
    C --> D[Upload bid documents]
    D --> E[Submit form]
  end
  subgraph R[Submit Controller]
    E --> F[Auth and CSRF check]
    F --> G[Rate-limit check]
    G --> H[Validate tender and file rules]
    H --> I{Valid?}
    I -->|No| X[Render error page]
  end
  subgraph M[Models and Documents]
    I -->|Yes| J[Create tender.bid]
    J --> K[Create attachments and tender.document]
    K --> L[Create documents.document records]
    L --> N[Set bid state submitted]
  end
  subgraph W[Website]
    N --> O[Render thank-you page with reference]
    O --> P([End])
    X --> P
  end
